  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV/AIDS - Bolivia (Plurinational State) (01-Sep-2016-31-Dec-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bolivia (Plurinational State), HIV, Humanist Institute for Co-operation with Developing Countries (Hivos) (HIVOS HQ)This program has the following goals: Contribute to reducing new HIV / AIDS cases maintaining them below 2.5% focusing on key populations with highest prevalence in Bolivia. The objectives of this program are: Improving access to prevention and HIV diagnosis to gay, bisexual and other men who have sex with men, women and trans sex workers.  Strengthening the linkage, retention and access to comprehensive care for HIV, other sexually transmitted infections and diseases associated with HIV / AIDS for people living with HIV</narrative>
  </description>
